and satisfy its ctutils 0.4.5 minimum. Keep Bazel registry facts consistent.
The incompatible crypto-bigint 0.5.5 dependency through age stays unchanged.

Requires rust-v0.163.0 (83086188ae0614bd882818ff1aa23f3194962012)
and the release patch queue through issue-71/latest-stable-dependencies.patch.
Validated in the complete current release queue context.

Validation: locked Cargo workspace metadata and just bazel-lock-check pass.
